  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The subject property is not located within convenient walking distance of town centre facilities, and is not located within an area with good public transport links. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Adopted Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 2 - The original property is less than 130 square metres in area, and therefore fails to meet the minimum size threshold to be considered suitable for conversion. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Adopted Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 3 - The applicant has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in increased disturbance to residents of neighbouring properties contrary to Adopted Local Plan polices CC2 and SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 4 - The application has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would have an acceptable impact on the local highway and not result in additional excessive parking stress on the roads surrounding the development. The proposed development is therefore contrary to Adopted Local Plan policy EC2. "
  ],
